id: 15
hanzi: 相敬如宾
pinyin: xiāng jìng rú bīn
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Idiom

meanings_summary:
  en: (of husband and wife) to respect each other like honored guests; mutual respect in marriage
  es: (entre cónyuges) respetarse mutuamente como huéspedes de honor; respeto conyugal ejemplar

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Idiom | Literary | married couples treating each other with the profound courtesy, decorum, and deference due to an honored guest | tratarse los cónyuges con la consideración, reverencia y cortesía debidas a un huésped de honor | 夫妻相敬如宾 (husband and wife respect each other like guests)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 这对学者夫妇相伴走过半个世纪的风雨，在日常生活中始终相敬如宾，被后辈学者传为佳话。 | Zhè duì xuézhě fūfù xiāngbàn zǒuguò bàn gè shìjì de fēngyǔ, zài rìcháng shēnghuó zhōng shǐzhōng xiāngjìngrúbīn, bèi hòubèi xuézhě chuán wéi jiāhuà. | This scholar couple walked through half a century of trials together, always respecting each other like honored guests in daily life, hailed by younger scholars as an exemplary union. | Este matrimonio de académicos compartió medio siglo de vicisitudes tratándose siempre con mutuo respeto ejemplar, admirados por las nuevas generaciones.
  #2 | 中国传统家风研究专家指出，“相敬如宾”不仅是一种婚姻处世哲学，更是维护古代家族制度秩序稳定的伦理基石。 | Zhōngguó chuántǒng jiāfēng yánjiū zhuānjiā zhǐchū, “xiāngjìngrúbīn” bùjǐn shì yì zhǒng hūnyīn chǔshì zhéxué, gèng shì wéihù gǔdài jiāzú zhìdù zhìxù wěndìng de lúnlǐ jīshí. | Experts on traditional Chinese family values note that 'respecting each other like guests' is not merely a philosophy of marriage, but an ethical cornerstone ensuring family stability. | Especialistas en tradiciones familiares chinas señalan que respetarse como huéspedes en el matrimonio constituye la base ética de la armonía y estabilidad del hogar.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  夫妻相敬如宾 | husband and wife respect each other like guests
  相敬如宾数十年 | respect each other like guests for decades
  始终相敬如宾 | remain courteous and respectful like guests throughout
  相敬如宾的生活 | a life of mutual marital courtesy
  相敬如宾的相处模式 | a relationship dynamic of mutual deference
  做到了相敬如宾 | achieved mutual deference in marriage

