character_decomposition[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  相 | xiāng | mutually; each other | mutuamente; el uno al otro | 目 | eye | 目 (eye looking) + 木 (tree/target observed) | 木 (phonetic association) | 9 | 左右结构 | Depicts an eye (目) carefully examining a tree (木), extended to mutually gazing and interacting. | An eye (目) looks across at a slender tree (木), symbolizing mutual observation. | Un ojo (目) contempla un árbol (木), reflejando una interacción y mirada mutua. | 55 | DUB | ""
  敬 | jìng | respect; honor; revere | respetar; venerar; honrar | 攵 | strike / action | 攵 (disciplined action) | 苟 (jìng, alert posture) | 12 | 左右结构 | Depicts adopting an alert, humble stance (苟) under self-discipline (攵), denoting reverence. | Under self-discipline (攵), one bows attentively with profound respect (敬). | Con autocontrol sereno (攵), uno se inclina mostrando respeto y reverencia. | 51 | TKOK | ""
  如 | rú | as if; like; similar to | como; al igual que; semejante a | 女 | woman | 女 (woman / harmony) | 口 (mouth) | 6 | 左右结构 | Ideogram of speech (口) complying harmoniously with instruction (女), signifying 'like' or 'accordance'. | Speaking from the mouth (口) with the graceful compliance of a lady (女) makes actions resemble words. | Expresarse desde la boca (口) con elegancia (女) asegura que todo transcurra conforme a lo debido. | 35 | VR | ""
  宾 | bīn | guest; visitor; receive with honor | huésped; invitado de honor | 宀 | roof | 宀 (hall/mansion welcoming guests) | 兵 / 贝 (bīn, precious gift exchange) | 10 | 上下结构 | Depicts a guest welcomed under the roof (宀) presented with gifts of cowrie shells (贝). | Under the mansion roof (宀), gifts are exchanged to honor the arriving guest (宾). | Bajo el techo señorial (宀), se ofrecen presentes para agasajar al huésped de honor (宾). | 55 | JOMC | 賓

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Treating each other (相) with solemn reverence (敬) just as (如) one honors an esteemed guest (宾) defines matrimonial decorum.
  composite_memory_hook_es: Tratarse mutuamente (相) con profundo respeto (敬) igual que (如) a un huésped distinguido (宾) define la virtud matrimonial.
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Originating in the Spring and Autumn Annals (左传·僖公三十三年), when Xi Que and his wife were observed weeding fields together with mutual courtesy like honoring an imperial guest. It became the highest traditional ideal of marital decorum without excessive casualness.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: 55-51-35-55 pitch pattern. Articulate four balanced syllables with distinct high level (55), falling (51), rising (35), and high level (55) contours.

